   "sourceHash": "6c24ce1edb7f53bdc1ac4c7f2ef0cf1493dd00cde41b4d55626c2d2895a27dae",
   "text": "Découvrez la philosophie du yoga et prenez le temps de l’introspection.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
